 tragedy. This Kaggle Getting Started Competition provides an ideal starting place for people who may not have a lot of experience in data science and machine learning.\"","topics":[],"score":219261,"global_rank":223929},{"name":"avi53/pc_deals_site","owner":"avi53","html_url":"https://github.com/avi53/pc_deals_site","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219256,"global_rank":223947},{"name":"Jamey134/counter","owner":"Jamey134","html_url":"https://github.com/Jamey134/counter","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219256,"global_rank":223951},{"name":"Jamey134/html_table","owner":"Jamey134","html_url":"https://github.com/Jamey134/html_table","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219256,"global_rank":223952},{"name":"haolam05/whack-a-mole","owner":"haolam05","html_url":"https://github.com/haolam05/whack-a-mole","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219256,"global_rank":223964},{"name":"haolam05/html-form","owner":"haolam05","html_url":"https://github.com/haolam05/html-form","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"Practice making HTML form","topics":[],"score":219256,"global_rank":223965},{"name":"celinedm/testrepo","owner":"celinedm","html_url":"https://github.com/celinedm/testrepo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"Part of a Coursera assignment","topics":[],"score":219256,"global_rank":223967},{"name":"RICHIE-YIN/GrabNGo","owner":"RICHIE-YIN","html_url":"https://github.com/RICHIE-YIN/GrabNGo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"Grab-N-Go is an online marketplace similar to the likes of Facebook marketplace, OfferUp, etc. It is a relatively simple application where users can post their items up for sal